  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "1 · Publish and summary",
      "items": [
        "Template Storage publishes TemplatePublished; the same event goes to two consumers",
        "Summary Service: generates the parent → new summary right away, from the JSON diff given by Version Diff",
        "Each region: the Reconciler updates its copy of the versions (lineage) and adds work for the worker",
        "Then the Reconciler asks the Summary Service for one summary per version in use in its region (here v3, v5 and v6 → v7): a few calls, not one per engagement. The request carries no firm data. A summary still missing later is fetched on demand",
        "There is no Version Catalog service: lineage is owned by Template Storage and reaches us only through the event",
        "When the user lists engagements everything is already in the region: pending = engagement version × copy of versions, and the summary is read from the regional copy. No engagement is loaded on this path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "2 · Activate a firm",
      "items": [
        "The worker asks Engagement Mgmt to load each engagement of the firm",
        "The worker never writes the index: the Reconciler does, when it receives EngagementLoaded. It is the same path as flow 3",
        "The feature is switched on only when every engagement of the firm is indexed",
        "The saga log lets the job resume after a crash without repeating loads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "3 · Reconcile on load",
      "items": [
        "The user already pays the 1-minute load; the check is free",
        "Match: only 'last verified' is updated",
        "Mismatch: a 'Reconciled' event is appended and a divergence metric is raised"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "4 · Decision and audit",
      "items": [
        "Engagement Mgmt stays the owner of the decision's effect",
        "The event carries the id of the exact summary shown, the user and the time",
        "Appended to the immutable event stream: this is the record defended in a review"
      ]
    }
  ]
